ره‌بخت شوی"}}]}, {"ref": "11:106", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1579.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "As for those who will be wretched (on that day) they will be in the Fire; sighing and wailing will be their portion therein,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Bedbaht olanlar ateştedirler. Onlar orada başka türlü soluyacak, başka türlü haykıracaklar.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو وہ جو بدبخت ہیں وہ تو دوزخ میں ہیں وہ اس گدھے کی طرح رینکیں گے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Adapun orang-orang yang celaka, maka (tempatnya) di dalam neraka, di dalamnya mereka mengeluarkan dan menarik nafas (dengan merintih),", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَأَمَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شَقُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/9b62fc520fab7c82c1fb.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "bili su nesretni", "en": "were wretched", "tr": "bahtsız oldular", "fr": "furent malheureux", "id": "mereka celaka", "ur": "وہ بدبخت ہوئے", "bn": "তারা হতভাগ্য হয়েছিল", "fa": "بدبخت بودند"}}, {"text": "فَفِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلنَّارِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "زَفِيرٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَشَهِيقٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "شَقُوا۟", "count": 1, "first": "11:106", "audio": "audio/9b62fc520fab7c82c1fb.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "bili su nesretni", "en": "were wretched", "tr": "bedbaht oldular", "fr": "ils étaient malheureux", "id": "mereka telah celaka", "ur": "وہ بدبخت تھے", "bn": "তারা দুর্ভাগা ছিল", "fa": "بدبخت بودند"}}, {"arabic": "لِتَشْقَىٰٓ", "count": 1, "first": "20:2", "audio": "audio/45a0952f9b567bb65f93.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"bs": "da budeš nesretan", "en": "that you should be distressed", "tr": "üzülmeniz için", "fr": "que tu sois malheureux", "id": "agar kamu bersedih", "ur": "کہ تم پریشان ہو", "bn": "যে তুমি কষ্ট পাও", "fa": "تا بدبخت باشی"}}, {"arabic": "فَتَشْقَىٰٓ", "count": 1, "first": "20:117", "audio": "audio/709cdac65337526d344d.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}]}, {"arabic": "يَشْقَىٰ", "count": 1, "first": "20:123", "audio": "audio/465d5943e6c793655e7d.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it is wretched", "bs": "biva nesretan", "tr": "bedbaht olur", "fr": "il est malheureux", "id": "dia celaka", "ur": "وہ بدبخت ہے", "bn": "সে দুর্ভাগা হয়", "fa": "بدبخت می‌شود"}}], "ayatFile": "ayat/0543.json", "ayatTranslations": {"en": "ayat/0543.en.json", "tr": "ayat/0543.tr.json", "ur": "ayat/0543.ur.json", "id": "ayat/0543.id.json"}, "sentences": [{"arabic": "شَقُوا فِي حَيَاتِهِمْ", "spoken": "audio/2be12635f3aca1e78a6d.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "translation": {"bs": "Bili su nesretni u svom životu.", "en": "They were unhappy in their life.", "bn": "তারা তাদের জীবনে দুর্ভাগা ছিল।", "fa": "در زندگی‌شان بدبخت بودند.", "fr": "Ils étaient malheureux dans leur vie.", "id": "Mereka celaka dalam kehidupan mereka.", "tr": "Hayatlarında mutsuz oldular.", "ur": "وہ اپنی زندگی میں بدبخت رہے۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "شَقُوا", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "bili su nesretni", "en": "were unhappy", "bn": "হতভাগ্য ছিল", "fa": 